  "factor_dispositions_note": "starting_pitcher has NO single artifact-level disposition here -- this artifact mixes real, already-played games with a projected rotation. attribution_by_game's 5 real games are MODEL-USED (see each row's own factor_dispositions); game 1 of pre_series_forecast and of every state_table row is MODEL-USED for the same reason a series opener's starters are always announced; every OTHER game in pre_series_forecast and in state_table is SCENARIO INPUT, never MODEL-USED, because its starter is a rotation projection, not a fact. Read each game's own factor_dispositions.starting_pitcher rather than this artifact-level map for that factor.",
